<!-- Introduction -->
<div class="container my-5">
  <h2>Introduction</h2>
  <p>At Pet Council, we believe every pet deserves to look and feel their best. Our team offers grooming services tailored for your pets in a stress-free and safe environment.</p>
</div>

<!-- Why should customers choose us? -->
<div class="container my-5">
  <h2>Why Choose Our Pet Grooming Services?</h2>
  <p>We use gentle techniques, premium products, and give your pets the best care they deserve. Our groomers are passionate, professional, and experienced in handling all kinds of breeds.</p>
</div>

<!-- Our Grooming Services -->
<div class="container my-5">
  <h2>Our Comprehensive Grooming Services</h2>
  <p>
    Our offerings include full grooming, nail trimming, de-shedding, ear cleaning, styling, and more. We cater to the unique grooming needs of each pet based on breed and lifestyle. At our Pet Council Grooming Centre, we provide both dog and cat grooming services tailored to meet your pet’s specific needs.
  </p>

  <h3>Dog Grooming Services</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Basic Dog Grooming Package</strong><br>
    Our groomers provide the following services in our basic package:
    Nail clipping, plucking of ear hair and ear cleaning, shaving of paw pads, bathing, conditioning, drying and brushing, trimming of fur at the nose bridge and around the paw.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Full Dog Grooming Package</strong><br>
    This includes all services offered in the basic package, with added hair styling or cutting services.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Bathing Services</strong><br>
    If you simply want your dog to enjoy a refreshing bath, we offer basic washing and drying services for canines of all sizes at our grooming centre.
  </p>

  <h3>Cat Grooming Services</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Basic Cat Grooming Package</strong><br>
    This includes nail clipping, ear cleaning, shaving of paw pads, and bathing, conditioning, drying and brushing.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Full Cat Grooming Package</strong><br>
    Includes all services provided under the basic grooming package, plus hair styling or cutting services.
  </p>
</div>

